; The translation: an mgtt export read as a writ model.
;
; It depends on [writ_json] to read the export document and NOTHING ELSE — not
; a data model, not a parser. That is not an accident of what it happens to
; need: the output is .writ TEXT, so a malformed export can never reach an
; engine, and the whole mapping stays testable without a filesystem.
;
; IO-free. bin/main.ml does the reading and the writing.

(library
 (name mgtt2writ)
 (libraries writ_json))
